WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Enterprise AI Control Plane
Decide what ships. Enforce the decision.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Portfolio: investment, risk, spend, and bottlenecks
across a generated sample organization. [SYNTHETIC]

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Pipeline: drag Mortgage Document Q&A into Evaluation.
Its approvals are in place. [SYNTHETIC]

4
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Meeting Notes is blocked: the business case is missing. [SYNTHETIC]

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Executive viewer: write controls disappear. [SYNTHETIC]

6
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Flow: see lifecycle movement and where apps stall. [SYNTHETIC]

7
00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Applications: search the registry by name, owner, or problem.
Filter by stage and health. [SYNTHETIC]

8
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Reviews: an independent reviewer checks evidence
and approves a gate. Submitters cannot approve themselves. [SYNTHETIC]

9
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:27.000
Business Case: compare breakeven precision.
Classifier 0.849; high capability 0.865; low cost 0.864. [ASSUMPTION]

10
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Net monthly value: classifier $57,270;
high capability $66,957; low cost $62,130. [ASSUMPTION]

11
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:44.000
Experiments: every configuration sees
the same 1,540 frozen cases. [MEASURED]

12
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:52.000
gemini-3.8-flash macro F1: 0.885.
The release floor is 0.893. [MEASURED]

13
00:01:52.000 --> 00:02:00.000
4 sensitive intents miss the 0.95 recall gate.
The lowest is 0.60. [MEASURED]

14
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:08.000
Decision Policy: deterministic routing.
Edit the cohort, then preview its release gates. [MEASURED]

15
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:15.000
Preview uses frozen results.
The app owner proposes the cohort for release. [MEASURED]

16
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:21.000
Shadow: 85.5% label agreement over 1,540 cases. [SIMULATED]

17
00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:27.000
$1.65 of measured model spend in shadow. [MEASURED]

18
00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:33.000
+151 USD net value over 14 days
for the cohort versus the classifier. [ASSUMPTION]

19
00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:43.000
Release: 5 of 10 full-candidate gates pass;
4 of 6 proposed-cohort gates pass. [MEASURED]

20
00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:51.000
Activate full is blocked because release gates fail. [MEASURED]

21
00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:58.000
A governance admin records Withhold with a rationale. [MEASURED]

22
00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:04.000
Monitoring: the incident opened on simulated day 10. [FIXTURE; MEASURED]

23
00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:10.000
Review rate: 0.2177 against 0.2172.
Breach margin: 0.0006. [SIMULATED; FIXTURE; MEASURED]

24
00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:16.000
Incidents: drift detected the day it began.
Automation paused; rollback restores human review. [FIXTURE; MEASURED]

25
00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:22.000
The drill records recovery. Automation resumed day 13. [FIXTURE; MEASURED]

26
00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:30.000
Audit: trace lifecycle changes, actors,
reasons, and evidence references. [MEASURED]

27
00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:38.000
Settings: admins manage roles.
Executive viewers have read-only access. [SYNTHETIC]

28
00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:43.000
IAP protects the console. Jobs produce durable evidence.

29
00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:48.000
Frozen evidence becomes a recorded release decision. [MEASURED]

30
00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:56.000
Withhold gemini-3.8-flash. Reject gemini-3.1-flash-lite.
Limits: single-rater labels, simulated traffic, benchmark gap. [MEASURED]

